WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
What’s your favorite part of Jazz Fest as a whole?

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:11.480
Like, if you’re going as a patron, or performing, or just being there, what’s your favorite part about it?

3
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.980
I like how it attracts music lovers to this city.

4
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:24.460
Whether I’m at Jazz Fest enjoying Jazz Fest or just playing on the street as . . . During Jazz Fest time,

5
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:29.300
it’s just very apparent that this is not your average crowd, you know?

6
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.640
It’s a very different crowd than say the Super Bowl crowd, of course. [laughs] It’s just very nice.

7
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:41.420
There’s something about people who really love music that just makes them very . . . I don’t know.

8
00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:45.080
Very nice to be around, you know?

9
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.040
There’s something about music.

10
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:52.160
And, of course, as a musician we love to play for people who love music, of course.

11
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.364
But it’s just . . . I don’t know.

12
00:00:53.364 --> 00:00:58.980
It’s kind of a charmed time for the city when like-minded people come.
